  "user_request": "The Student Association just invited me to two social events this week: a mid-week Board Game & Coffee night on Wednesday from 19:30 to 21:30, and an End-of-Exams Sunset Dinner on Friday from 19:30 to 22:00 (20 minutes from the training center). Since I have my Business Law exam on Friday at 10:00 and strict 23:00 sleep blocks for my 07:30 morning trainings, I can probably only attend one of them properly—or attend Wednesday briefly and go to Friday's dinner since my exams finish Friday noon. Please fit the best social option(s) into my week while preserving all my training sessions, 8 hours of sleep, and at least 5 hours of Business Law study on Wednesday and Thursday."
